ArchBang KEYBINDINGS
═════════════════════

NOTE: Super = Windows Key


APPLICATIONS
───────────────────────

Super + Return          Terminal (foot)
Super + Space           Launcher (noctalia)
Super + w               Web Browser (firefox)
Super + f               File Manager (thunar)
Super + s               Control Center (noctalia)
Super + d               System Monitor (dgop)
Super + p               Screenshot (full)
Super + Shift + s       Screenshot (region)
Super + ,               Settings (noctalia)
Super + v               Media / Audio panel (noctalia)
Super + Shift + Space   Window Switcher (noctalia)
Super + b               Wallpaper picker (noctalia)
Super + k               Open Keybindings (l3afpad)


WINDOW CONTROLS
───────────────────────

Super + q               Close Window
Super + Ctrl + s        Toggle Float
Super + F11             Fullscreen
Super + Shift + f       Fake Fullscreen
Super + a               Maximise
Super + i               Minimise
Super + Shift + I       Restore Minimised
Super + z               Scratchpad
Super + o               Toggle Overlay


FOCUS & MOVEMENT
───────────────────────

Super + Tab             Next Window
Super + Ctrl + ←/→/↑/↓   Focus Direction
Super + Shift + ←/→/↑/↓  Swap Window Direction
Ctrl + Shift + ←/→/↑/↓   Move Window (50px)
Ctrl + Super + ←/→/↑/↓   Resize Window (50px)


WORKSPACES
───────────────────────

Super + [1-9]           Switch to Workspace
Super + Shift + [1-9]   Send Window to Workspace
Super + Left/Right      Previous/Next Workspace
Ctrl + Left/Right       Move with Window to Prev/Next


LAYOUT
───────────────────────

Super + n               Switch Layout Mode
Super + e               Set Proportion Full
Super + x               Cycle Proportion Preset
Super + g               Toggle Gaps
Super + Shift + X       Increase Gaps
Super + Shift + Z       Decrease Gaps


MULTI-MONITOR
───────────────────────

Super + Alt + Left/Right        Focus Monitor
Super + Ctrl + Alt + Left/Right Send to Monitor


SYSTEM
───────────────────────

Super + l               Lock Screen (noctalia)
Super + Shift + e       Power panel (noctalia)
Super + r               Reload Config
Super + m               Quit MangoWC
Vol Up (XF86)           Increase Volume (O.S.D.)
Vol Down (XF86)         Decrease Volume (O.S.D.)
Mute (XF86)             Toggle Mute (O.S.D.)
Brightness Up (XF86)    Increase Brightness (O.S.D.)
Brightness Down (XF86)  Decrease Brightness (O.S.D.)
